title: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>が[? if dnvp_ideology == "Moderate":<span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> ?][? if kvp_formed:<span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>?]と合併！
subtitle: [+ dvp_leader +]と[? if dnvp_ideology == "Moderate":[+ dnvp_leader +] ?][? if kvp_formed:[+ kvp_leader +] ?]が合意に達した。
view-if: dkp_merger_timer == time
max-visits: 1
